WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.426 --> 00:00:04.432
Unit twenty-five. Being a Good Digital Citizen!

2
00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:10.568
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.618 --> 00:00:13.419
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.469 --> 00:00:17.949
Today we learn about Being a Good Digital Citizen. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.122 --> 00:00:24.044
Digital citizen. Say it with me. Digital citizen!

6
00:00:27.591 --> 00:00:31.524
Kind. Say it with me. Kind!

7
00:00:35.011 --> 00:00:38.842
Honest. Say it with me. Honest!

8
00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:46.000
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

9
00:00:49.497 --> 00:00:53.653
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

10
00:00:57.157 --> 00:01:00.906
Share. Say it with me. Share!

11
00:01:04.426 --> 00:01:07.826
Help. Say it with me. Help!

12
00:01:11.286 --> 00:01:15.602
Online. Say it with me. Online!

13
00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:29.941
A good digital citizen is kind, honest, and safe online. I show respect, share carefully, and help others. I act online the same way I would in real life.

14
00:01:29.991 --> 00:01:33.857
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:40.862
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:40.912 --> 00:01:42.062
Honest!

17
00:01:43.063 --> 00:01:48.590
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:49.790
Help!

19
00:01:50.605 --> 00:01:57.318
Did you know? Being a good digital citizen means following the same good rules online as you do offline!

20
00:01:57.368 --> 00:01:59.560
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:08.371
Think and answer. How can you be kind online?

22
00:02:08.421 --> 00:02:09.624
Great answer!

23
00:02:10.648 --> 00:02:18.578
Congratulations, everyone! You finished Technology Grade 2. Keep exploring technology safely. Goodbye!

24
00:02:18.628 --> 00:02:22.601
